<ptxt>
<emph>
P0131: O2 Sensor Circuit Low Voltage
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Output voltage of HO2S-1 signal circuit is lower than 0.05 V for 25 sec.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(3 D/C detection logic (type A))
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(2 D/C detection logic (type B))
</ptxt>
</entry>
