</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ECM
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph>
P0132: O2 Sensor Circuit High Voltage
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Output voltage of HO2S-1 signal circuit is higher than 1.25 V for 25 sec.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(3 D/C detection logic (type A))
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(2 D/C detection logic (type B))
</ptxt>
</entry>
